(text "STM32G071KBT6N LQFP32: PA8=UCPD1_CC1, PB15=UCPD1_CC2, PB6/PB7=I2C1, PA13/PA14=SWD.\nSource-only power path. UCPD dead-battery pins grounded; disable dead-battery function in firmware.\nBoot from flash using option bytes; preserve NRST function. Firmware required; no PD stack is generated here." (at 12 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1278fa74-4d62-5220-8f14-695c7bf0210c"))
